Package: dispatchr
Title: Lightweight Outbound Messaging for Agentic Workflows
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Oliver", "Zhou", email = "oliver.yxzhou@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Oliver Zhou [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Oliver Zhou <oliver.yxzhou@gmail.com>
Description: Send outbound messages through Gmail SMTP, X, and Telegram.
    The package is intentionally small and focused on message delivery for
    agentic workflows rather than broader communication management.
